                "description": "The Turino Lever with Lancaster Rose has an eye-catching design that makes a great choice for traditional homes. The Ornate Turino Leverset with Lancaster Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit standard pre-drilled doors that are 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
